# mycustos local overrides — copy to config/mycustos.local.conf (optional).
#
# Put here ONLY the values this server customises: every other key keeps the
# value of mycustos.conf (or the built-in default). A key set here overrides the
# same key of mycustos.conf, with no warning; a key twice in this file is an
# error. Same format, same keys and same rules as mycustos.conf: read, never
# executed; a regular file owned by the running user or root, not writable by
# group or others.
#
# "mycustos config show" tells, for every key, the file and line it comes from.

# Examples (uncomment and adapt):
#instance=db-a
#retention_days=14
#mysql_socket=/var/lib/mysql/mysql.sock
#expect_hostname=db-a
#expect_port=3306
